{"id":"utah-mighty-five","title":"Utah's Mighty Five","who":"Classic route · five national parks by car","when":"April–May and September–October","vehicle":"Car or camper, 7–12 days","kind":"car","color":"#c2410c","summary":"Zion's canyon, Bryce's hoodoos, Capitol Reef's orchards and cliffs, then Arches and Canyonlands around Moab, linked by Scenic Byway 12, one of America's great drives. Book Arches timed entry in season and start hikes early.","sources":[{"label":"Senthil Jayaseelan: Utah Mighty 5, June 2025","url":"https://senthiljayaseelan.blogspot.com/2025/07/utah-mighty-5-national-parks-june-2025.html"},{"label":"Von's SW America road trip: the Mighty 5 (May 2025)","url":"https://vonsswamericaroadtrip.blogspot.com/2025/05/utahs-mighty-5-national-parks-they-did.html"}],"approximate":"A common route from Las Vegas to Moab.","km":948,"bbox":[-115.1482,36.1678,-109.539,38.9914],"stops":[{"name":"Las Vegas","place":"Las Vegas, Nevada","at":[36.1674,-115.1484],"text":"The usual arrival: pick up the car and head north-east.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/0/0e/Center_Strip_Before_Sunrise.jpg/500px-Center_Strip_Before_Sunrise.jpg","page":"Las Vegas","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Center_Strip_Before_Sunrise.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Zion","place":"Springdale, Utah","at":[37.1889,-112.9986],"text":"Angels Landing or the Narrows, walking up the river between canyon walls.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/10/Zion_angels_landing_view.jpg/500px-Zion_angels_landing_view.jpg","page":"Zion National Park","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Zion_angels_landing_view.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Bryce Canyon","place":"Bryce Canyon City, Utah","at":[37.6741,-112.1565],"text":"Amphitheatres of orange hoodoos; walk down among them at sunrise.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c3/Inspiration_Point_Bryce_Canyon_November_2018_panorama.jpg/500px-Inspiration_Point_Bryce_Canyon_November_2018_panorama.jpg","page":"Bryce Canyon National Park","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Inspiration_Point_Bryce_Canyon_November_2018_panorama.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Escalante","place":"Escalante, Utah","at":[37.7703,-111.6022],"text":"Scenic Byway 12 over the Hogback, a ridge with drops on both sides.","source":{"label":"Von's SW road trip (2025)","url":"https://vonsswamericaroadtrip.blogspot.com/2025/05/utahs-mighty-5-national-parks-they-did.html"}},{"name":"Capitol Reef","place":"Torrey, Utah","at":[38.2997,-111.4205],"text":"The quiet one: pick fruit in the Fruita orchards under red cliffs.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/1f/Capitol_Reef_National_Park.jpg/500px-Capitol_Reef_National_Park.jpg","page":"Capitol Reef National Park","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Capitol_Reef_National_Park.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Goblin Valley","place":"Goblin Valley State Park","at":[38.5982,-110.7],"text":"A valley of strange mushroom rocks, a fun detour.","photo":{"url":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/3d/Utah_-_North_America_-_Goblin_Valley_State_Park_-_Hoodoos_%284892269801%29.jpg/500px-Utah_-_North_America_-_Goblin_Valley_State_Park_-_Hoodoos_%284892269801%29.jpg","page":"Goblin Valley State Park","source":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Utah_-_North_America_-_Goblin_Valley_State_Park_-_Hoodoos_%284892269801%29.jpg","credit":"Wikimedia Commons","license":"free licence"}},{"name":"Moab","place":"Moab, Utah","at":[38.5738,-109.5462],"text":"The base for the last two parks, and for jeep and bike trails."},{"name":"Arches","place":"Arches National Park","at":[38.7265,-109.563],"text":"Delicate Arch at sunset, more than 2,000 stone arches in all.","source":{